{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tears of the Maker is a roguelike deck builder. It requires a good use of card combinations and planning in order to defeat your enemies and take control of your fate.  </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tears flow to the chambers to determine who takes damage. Use the cards to manipulate various aspects of the game to gain the advantage. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249470/extras/6e5fdace3c2e2546c5f2d61bf3e4c2dc.avif?t=1773104099\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Story Mode, collect powerful cards and grow your stats to save the land from a mysterious evil.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Endless Mode, no two runs are the same\u2014only a well-forged deck can carry you through the unknown. You must build your deck in between each round as you earn money from defeating enemies.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249470/extras/5d2660d5a66b5cf83b7f2aaa7adb5e13.avif?t=1773104099\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249470?t=1773104099","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steam